1. raster_source_pattern_new: simplify NULL check and error handling.
2. get_snapshot, get_copy, get_finish: return proper new references (INCREF Py_None when returning it).

Let me also double check `raster_source_pattern_get_acquire`:
```c
return Py_BuildValue ("(OO)", priv->acquire.callback ? priv->acquire.callback : Py_None,
                      priv->release.callback ? priv->release.callback : Py_None);
```
Py_BuildValue with O increments each. Good.

